{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"wuzhu-e-o111a","title":"吕岱讨李桓等","accounts":[{"id":"wuzhu-e-o111a-account","label":"《吴主传第二》正文","text":"吕岱讨李桓等","evidence":["wuzhu-e-o111a-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wuzhu-p0086","role":"进讨","evidence":["wuzhu-e-o111a-q"]},{"person":"wuzhu-p0084","role":"被讨","evidence":["wuzhu-e-o111a-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"year":235,"label":"嘉禾四年夏","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"wuzhu-y235","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"wuzhu-q-o111","basis":"嘉禾四年夏"},"evidence":["wuzhu-e-o111a-q","wuzhu-q-o111","houfei-q-o025","houfei-q-b-e47ffea5cca5eab53d92"]},"ordering_evidence":"wuzhu-e-o111a-q","source_order":[47,562,"O111a"],"order":8323}],"persons":[{"id":"wuzhu-p0084","name":"李桓","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wuzhu-p0086","name":"吕岱","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"houfei-q-b-e47ffea5cca5eab53d92","section":"chapter-005","block":"b-e47ffea5cca5eab53d92","layer":"modern","quote":"〖15〗三年：青龙三年（公元 235）。","section_title":"后妃传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0015.xhtml","index":113,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-4aa0b3373c71cedadeb9","start":0,"end":20,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"houfei-q-o025","section":"chapter-005","block":"b-0744a279ae4c62a54e64","layer":"original","quote":"青龙二年春，追谥后兄俨曰安城乡穆侯。夏，吴贼寇扬州，以像为伏波将军〖12〗，持节，监诸将东征〖13〗。还，复为射声校尉〖14〗。三年薨〖15〗，追赠卫将军，改封魏昌县，谥曰贞侯。子畅嗣。又封畅弟温、4 、艳，皆为列侯。四年〖16〗，改逸、俨本封，皆曰魏昌侯，谥因故〖17〗。封俨世妇刘为东乡君〖18〗，又追封逸世妇张为安喜君。","section_title":"后妃传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0015.xhtml","index":97,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":163,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuzhu-e-o111a-q","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-fb2c79bf54078d88d523","layer":"original","quote":"四年夏〖13〗，遣